**Cleric 6 (Peace Domain) | Drow Elf | Player: Gary Young**

**Stats (from sheet):** HP 45 max | AC 18 | WIS +4 (Spell Save DC 15, Attack +7) | Insight +10 (Expertise) | Speed 30 ft. | Channel Divinity ×3/LR | 120 ft. Darkvision
